<title>SOUTH KOREA: Daewoo wins $22 mln Taiwan bus order.</title>
<headline>Daewoo wins $22 mln Taiwan bus order.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daewoo Corp, a unit of South Korea's Daewoo Group, said on Thursday it had won a $22 million order to export 234 buses to Taiwan.</p>
<p>Daewoo said in a statement the buses, which will be used in Taipei, would be delivered to a state-run bus company by the end of this year.</p>
</text>
